### Command examples

```powershell
# One-shot AI request
.\gemma.ps1 -Headless -Prompt "Explain this error"

# Machine-readable AI response
.\gemma.ps1 -Headless -Json -Prompt "Summarize this log"

# Pipe file content into the model
Get-Content .\error.log -Raw | .\gemma.ps1 -Headless -Stdin -Prompt "Analyze this log"

# Fast grounded Google Search through Antigravity OAuth
.\gemma.ps1 -Search "latest PowerShell release" -Json

# Local commands, no model request
.\gemma.ps1 -Command system-info -Json
.\gemma.ps1 -Command clipboard-read -Json
.\gemma.ps1 -Command window-list -Json
.\gemma.ps1 -Command settings-open -CommandArgument display
.\gemma.ps1 -Command ui-tree -CommandArgument 0x123456
.\gemma.ps1 -Command ui-action -CommandArgument "0x123456|AutomationId|invoke"

# User-authored skills
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force "$HOME\.gemma\skills"
# Save a skill as $HOME\.gemma\skills\my-skill.md
```

